  "behaviour": [
    "One storage port, two adapters (Cloudflare R2, DigitalOcean Spaces), both S3-compatible, chosen by STORAGE_DRIVER (R2 ruling).",
    "The browser uploads straight to storage with a signed URL the API issues, then calls confirm; the API never proxies file bytes.",
    "Buckets are private; reads are short-lived signed URLs; photo addresses expire (T-74). Storage encrypted at rest by the provider.",
    "Image sizes are made on upload (a job after confirm). Uploads never confirmed are removed by a job.",
    "Vault usage per business is the sum of bytes of ready vault files; it feeds Vault billing (blocks of 100 GB).",
    "Customer photos and words never train AI (T-74).",
    "Replaces data URLs in localStorage (STUB-7, STUB-24, maker.ts:403, Voice.tsx:48)."
  ],
